OL,3,GNEWSA'Easier to get Glasto tickets than
OL,4,Afarm funding'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Kent farmer who lost out on funding
OL,7,Ffor his environmental plans after a
OL,8,Fgovernment scheme ran out in under six
OL,9,Fhours said he would have "better luck
OL,10,Ftrying to get Glastonbury tickets".
OL,12,FGeorge Holdstock, a fourth-generation
OL,13,Ffarmer, said applying for the
OL,14,FSustainable Farming Incentive (SFI26)
OL,15,Ffelt "like a lottery or a scramble".
OL,17,FThis scheme funds farmers for
OL,18,Fenvironmentally friendly land
OL,19,Fmanagement as part of the post-Brexit
OL,20,Freplacement of EU farming subsidies.
OL,23,APub: 11-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
