OL,3,GNEWSA'Easier to get Glasto tickets than
OL,4,Afarm funding'
OL,5,
OL,6,FFarming Minister Stephen Morgan said he
OL,7,Fwas "exploring alternatives to a
OL,8,Ffirst-come, first-served application
OL,9,Fprocess".
